## Outputs

After `terraform apply` completes:

```bash
terraform output odb_networks      # Network IDs and ARNs per instance
terraform output exadata_infras    # Infra IDs and ARNs per instance
terraform output vm_clusters       # Cluster IDs and OCIDs per instance
terraform output db_servers        # DB Server IDs per cluster
```

Example:
```hcl
odb_networks = {
{% for n in networks %}
  "{{ n.module_name }}" = {
    network_id  = "<resolved-at-apply>"
    network_arn = "<resolved-at-apply>"
  }
{% endfor %}
}
```

